groovebox-scene 1
# Syn 1 on pad 1 through the panel: MENU + step 3, then OK, down and OK in the sound picker. A tap
# of PADS/KEYS then makes the pads keys that play Syn 1.
input 0 press menu
input 8 press step-3
input 16 release step-3
input 24 release menu
input 32 press ok
input 40 release ok
input 48 press down
input 56 release down
input 64 press ok
input 72 release ok
input 80 press pads-keys
input 88 release pads-keys
# The records apply the first two notes later than the steps after their hits: messages 1 and 2
# at 1024 and 1536, after New synth's message 0.
input 100 pad-hit 0 127
step 128
applied 1 1024
input 700 pad-hit 7 64
step 1024
applied 2 1536
step 1536
frame 1536
input 2000 pad-release 7
step 4096
frame 4096
input 4200 pad-release 0
step 8192
end 9600
